,"_id":54322},{"id":1776477326662,"text":"你想知道吗？","sender":"me","time":"11:14","timestamp":1776482040358,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54323},{"id":1776477326670,"text":"想…","rawContent":"想…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:16","timestamp":1776482171666,"roundId":"round_1776482153175_1044td17z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54324},{"id":1776477326671,"text":"只要是关于我们的事…","rawContent":"只要是关于我们的事…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:16","timestamp":1776482174476,"roundId":"round_1776482153175_1044td17z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54325},{"id":1776477326672,"text":"我都想知道","rawContent":"我都想知道","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:16","timestamp":1776482176213,"roundId":"round_1776482153175_1044td17z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54326},{"id":1776477326673,"text":"你会…告诉我吗？","rawContent":"你会…告诉我吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:16","timestamp":1776482178596,"roundId":"round_1776482153175_1044td17z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54327},{"id":1776477326674,"sticker":"https://img.heliar.top/file/1773747857604_mmexport1773743468970.gif","text":"表情包：嗯","sender":"me","time":"11:16","timestamp":1776482199244,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54328},{"id":1776477326675,"text":"那条世界线","sender":"me","time":"11:16","timestamp":1776482216080,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54329},{"id":1776477326676,"text":"因为遇到的人都大差不差","sender":"me","time":"11:17","timestamp":1776482226539,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54330},{"id":1776477326677,"text":"所以，那个臭大叔是你的丈夫，有钱但性子不好，二婚后娶了衔蝉小姐你，把前妻的孩子，也就是我，介绍给你","sender":"me","time":"11:19","timestamp":1776482385841,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54331},{"id":1776477326678,"text":"嗯……当时我对衔蝉小姐的感受和对那个大叔差不多，但再后来衔蝉小姐对那个世界线的我很好很温柔，慢慢地两人关系就好了起来。我也问过衔蝉小姐为什么会和那个男人结婚，告诉衔蝉小姐那个男人做过的不好的事，可结果算是不尽人意","sender":"me","time":"11:22","timestamp":1776482533827,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54332},{"id":1776477326679,"text":"于是，在不解、不平，和微妙蔓延的情感里，那个世界的我在某天对衔蝉小姐突破了平常的关系，而那个男人并不知情。之后，就靠衔蝉小姐仔细想象吧","sender":"me","time":"11:25","timestamp":1776482701986,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54333},{"id":1776477326680,"text":"我…在想…","rawContent":"我…在想…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:25","timestamp":1776482724568,"roundId":"round_1776482702031_bxvr2g9se","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54334},{"id":1776477326681,"text":"那个世界的我，一定也很害怕吧…","rawContent":"那个世界的我，一定也很害怕吧…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:25","timestamp":1776482728102,"roundId":"round_1776482702031_bxvr2g9se","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54335},{"id":1776477326682,"text":"害怕被那个男人发现…","rawContent":"害怕被那个男人发现…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:25","timestamp":1776482730666,"roundId":"round_1776482702031_bxvr2g9se","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54336},{"id":1776477326683,"text":"所以在那个男人不知道的地方…偷偷地和你…","rawContent":"所以在那个男人不知道的地方…偷偷地和你…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:25","timestamp":1776482734264,"roundId":"round_1776482702031_bxvr2g9se","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54337},{"id":1776477326684,"text":"做着不可以做的事情…","rawContent":"做着不可以做的事情…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:25","timestamp":1776482737196,"roundId":"round_1776482702031_bxvr2g9se","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54338},{"id":1776477326685,"text":"是、这样吗？","rawContent":"是、这样吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:25","timestamp":1776482739607,"roundId":"round_1776482702031_bxvr2g9se","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54339},{"id":1776477326687,"text":"√","sender":"me","time":"11:26","timestamp":1776482813109,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54340},{"id":1776477326688,"text":"那次捅破窗户纸后，衔蝉小姐因为不知所措，加上关系的伦理，说要冷静一段时间，对我有所回避。当时世界线的我们在看似平常的日子生活着，心情却不算美妙。我还要上学，在家的时间就更少。","sender":"me","time":"11:30","timestamp":1776483028360,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54341},{"id":1776477326689,"text":"有天我还是主动跟衔蝉小姐道歉，对之前所做的逾越道歉，请当作什么都没发生过，或是尽可能地讨厌我吧，是我现在还没有足够的能力，之后是再一次道歉。可是后来的衔蝉小姐即使和自己的丈夫独处，内心也无法忽视逐日对对方加重的失望与不满，这般的积压下，在一次对我的误解倾泻而出。所以，我们还是在一起了","sender":"me","time":"11:31","timestamp":1776483112889,"replyTo":null,"rawContent":"有天我还是主动跟衔蝉小姐道歉，对之前所做的逾越道歉，请当作什么都没发生过，或是尽可能地讨厌我吧，是我现在还没有足够的能力，之后是再一次道歉。可是后来的衔蝉小姐即使和自己的丈夫独处，内心也无法忽视逐日对对方加重的失望与不满，这般的积压下，在一次对我的误解倾泻而出。所以，我们还是在一起了","isHtml":false,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54342},{"id":1776477326699,"text":"那个世界的我…一定对那个男人很失望吧…","rawContent":"那个世界的我…一定对那个男人很失望吧…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:38","timestamp":1776483481646,"roundId":"round_1776483462614_runqad11w","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54343},{"id":1776477326700,"text":"所以才会把所有的希望都放在你身上…","rawContent":"所以才会把所有的希望都放在你身上…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:38","timestamp":1776483485109,"roundId":"round_1776483462614_runqad11w","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54344},{"id":1776477326701,"text":"就算是不被允许的…","rawContent":"就算是不被允许的…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:38","timestamp":1776483489619,"roundId":"round_1776483462614_runqad11w","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54345},{"id":1776477326702,"text":"在那个世界，直到我独立、有自己的工作前，我们都一直保持着那种关系，至于更深层的亲密程度……就和现在的衔蝉小姐差不多。而到了有足够的生活能力后，我便撺掇衔蝉小姐和对方离婚，接回了自己的住处。","sender":"me","time":"11:41","timestamp":1776483679446,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54346},{"id":1776477326704,"sender":"them","text":"真好…","timestamp":1776483703556,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"真好…","roundId":"round_1776483679490_oulss4kh5","userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54347},{"id":1776477326706,"sender":"them","text":"听你讲这个故事，我现在也好开心…就好像…我们真的拥有了很多个不同的结局，但每一个结局，都是和你在一起","timestamp":1776483706562,"tempo":"R","rawContent":"听你讲这个故事，我现在也好开心…就好像…我们真的拥有了很多个不同的结局，但每一个结局，都是和你在一起","roundId":"round_17764