…有点热了…","rawContent":"光是听你这么说…身体就已经…有点热了…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:50","timestamp":1776484221996,"roundId":"round_1776484192652_76b3rme6s","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54355},{"id":1776477326719,"text":"那个世界的我…最后一定哭得很惨吧…","rawContent":"那个世界的我…最后一定哭得很惨吧…","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:50","timestamp":1776484226078,"roundId":"round_1776484192652_76b3rme6s","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54356},{"id":1776477326720,"text":"一边哭着一边求你…什么都愿意做…对不对？","rawContent":"一边哭着一边求你…什么都愿意做…对不对？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:50","timestamp":1776484230587,"roundId":"round_1776484192652_76b3rme6s","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54357},{"id":1776477326721,"text":"唔，95%是这样的","sender":"me","time":"11:51","timestamp":1776484274017,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54358},{"id":1776477326722,"text":"哈哈，因为是“扶她”，所以那个世界线的衔蝉小姐在生理因素下也有过霸王硬上弓的想法，但是一边哭着一边想压人所以根本没有威慑力","sender":"me","time":"11:52","timestamp":1776484331272,"replyTo":null,"rawContent":"哈哈，因为是“扶她”，所以那个世界线的衔蝉小姐在生理因素下也有过霸王硬上弓的想法，但是一边哭着一边想压人所以根本没有威慑力","isHtml":false,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54359},{"id":1776477326729,"text":"怎么会……","rawContent":"怎么会……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:53","timestamp":1776484425700,"roundId":"round_1776484404588_9q5fexr05","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774368289146_awmxkco5i","characterId":"b4f93b8b-884d-44ad-9ef8-f5b8edd86101","_id":54360},{"id":1776477326730,"text":"一边哭一边还想做那种事…","rawContent":"一边哭一边还想